module

/-! # The definitions of the Challenge

The definitions that `{{root}}Challenge` states its theorems with, between the markers of
`scripts/sync_challenge_defs.py`, which copies them word for word into the Challenge
(formalize-math-paper, `references/palomar.md`, Section 2).

This module imports exactly what the Challenge imports: Lean, Mathlib, and nothing from this
project, from `Phylogenetics` or from any other repository of the collection. The library proves
that these definitions agree with those of `Phylogenetics` that it uses. -/
